#: ../../packages/legal/src/PrivacyHosting.tsx#PrivacyHosting
msgid ""
"Each page request processes the following categories of technical connection "
"data: network identification data (IP address), time-related metadata "
"(timestamp), usage data (requested URL), technical metadata (browser type, "
"operating system, and device information), and the language preference "
"transmitted by the browser (Accept-Language). According to a contractual "
"assurance by Bunny.net, this data is held exclusively in working memory (RAM) "
"and automatically deleted after 20–30 seconds. According to this assurance, "
"no persistent storage takes place."
msgstr ""
"Each page request processes the following categories of technical connection "
"data: network identification data (IP address), time-related metadata "
"(timestamp), usage data (requested URL), technical metadata (browser type, "
"operating system, and device information), and the language preference "
"transmitted by the browser (Accept-Language). According to a contractual "
"assurance by Bunny.net, this data is held exclusively in working memory (RAM) "
"and automatically deleted after 20–30 seconds. According to this assurance, "
"no persistent storage takes place."

